// VertexLitGeneric and UnlitGeneric with $bumpmap or $lightwarptexture and no
// $phong (vertexlit_and_unlit_generic_bump_ps20b /
// vertexlit_and_unlit_generic_bump_vs20): per-pixel lighting of the bumped
// normal (ambient cube, point, spot and directional lights, four lights with
// the fourth packed in the w components, half-Lambert, the light warp),
// cube env maps (tint, contrast, saturation, the normal map alpha mask),
// detail textures and blend modes, self-illumination (by base alpha and by
// the vertex-normal Fresnel), the base-alpha tint blend, translucency and
// range fog, over a varied tangent frame (TANGENT user data, both binormal
// signs). No native family draws this pair. Quads are in clip space (identity
// transforms), so the eye is at the origin.
